Cell["\<\
{((-1 - 2*(omega_n) + 2*(omega_n)^2)*(omega_n1)^2)/(2 + 4*(1 + \
(omega_n))*(omega_n1)), 
 (1 + 2*(1 + (omega_n))*(omega_n1) + (1 + 2*(omega_n) - \
2*(omega_n)^2)*(omega_n1)^2)/(2 + 4*(1 + (omega_n))*(omega_n1)), -3/2, 1}\
\>", "Output",
